      "content": "i hear what you're saying about respect, but i'm worried about the practical side of it. if i write the handbook to be strictly mandatory, am i risking a huge backlash from people who feel like their own values are being attacked? how do i handle the fact that some employees see this as a loss of freedom rather than just a way to be kind?",
